{"code":"geocoach-usa-bollards","tips":[{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68986","section":"Oregon","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=x6cLH4PJCzMXBqEYSfd9fQ&viewpoint=44.63640906095763%2C-117.86768147333046&heading=52.54063998867706&pitch=-18.871848436399404","text":"White rectangular reflector on top.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68986"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68980","section":"California","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=lhrmHm3zvV67RA6sZf00MQ&viewpoint=40.05798069876082%2C-121.61326313371468&heading=226.47722964954772&pitch=-4.9962231754685575","text":"Similar to Oregon's, except the reflector is usually slightly shorter, and a part of the metal bar is visible above the reflector","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68980"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68983","section":"Nevada","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=OFDmHZ1zc7P7ZaD7gUikNA&viewpoint=40.47402771373333%2C-118.0727204523756&heading=195.15079170890297&pitch=-7.43730139705248","text":"White rectangle in black outline.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68983"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68982","section":"Montana/South Dakota","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=NYNmhL3HqGxdw1gQk8vAcw&viewpoint=44.00878525870004%2C-97.70885101413108&heading=226.71175414421845&pitch=-4.485217567800902","text":"White diamond reflector on top. In Montana reflector is usually attached to the stick with 1 bolt, while South Dakota mostly uses two. Also sometimes found in Nebraska and North Dakota.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68982"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68991","section":"Washington","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Xp3xo3tknVALqJ7Dt99Qog&viewpoint=47.13196607361691%2C-118.5353423318462&heading=133.54548601366778&pitch=-10.485451865411008","text":"Brown bollard with white reflector.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68991"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68984","section":"New Mexico/Colorado","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=_H5pxqf8iAnF20TyBdEKZw&viewpoint=35.467025639832194%2C-104.57324635486496&heading=281.4808967327254&pitch=-4.957488501522619","text":"Three circles on top.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68984"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68985","section":"Northeastern States","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=krX8hKa-4yP-95SKZEi2eA&viewpoint=43.296012836726426%2C-71.99087605950432&heading=110.59195438751536&pitch=-11.710223416873106","text":"In Maine, New Hampshire and Massachusetts you can find bollards with red or green rectangular reflectors on the ends of bridges and guardrails.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68985"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68987","section":"Pennsylvania","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=HJdgVIQgHGwXGXtjVCWM8w&viewpoint=39.752463897622526%2C-79.39347188901807&heading=345.99734260264444&pitch=-6.816941557349082","text":"Has a black horizontal cap near the top. The bollard can be yellow.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68987"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68988","section":"Utah","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Lersi27YNYHkJno1jQm3jA&viewpoint=38.18089121604516%2C-112.0186568585064&heading=60.042391904745266&pitch=-3.917425656217219","text":"White and black rectangular reflector.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68988"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68989","section":"Utah/Idaho/Arizona","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=Xwim_RDTSRFHlpwlZWZOKg&viewpoint=44.25090822438245%2C-114.5731391362287&heading=258.21642509779434&pitch=-10.54671939263278","text":"This bollard with white square reflector is found in three states in different variations. In Arizona there is only 1 bolt visible on the square(leftmost photo), while in Utah there are two(in the center). In Idaho reflector isn't mounted on the very top of the bollard(rightmost photo).","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68989"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68981","section":"Idaho/Colorado","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=nLGXm5SFY5_51aROznJU5Q&viewpoint=43.129996253861414%2C-114.0650158562078&heading=219.50225059433615&pitch=-6.7052303270917974","text":"Green bollard with white rectangular reflector. Reflector can be both short and long.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68981"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68994","section":"Wyoming/Colorado","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=2V3jKSneD-foZCPfWFPnuQ&viewpoint=39.65268402766312%2C-107.88330822859928&heading=359.6893219768983&pitch=-10.582111102054569","text":"One circular reflector on top.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68994"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68992","section":"Wyoming(Colorado type)","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=nhzcSlytujmp2AvG7E0NQg&viewpoint=42.4607930745036%2C-104.71617433011676&heading=58.50476101616669&pitch=-7.461931544422356","text":"Similar to Wyoming/Colorado, but with painted top","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68992"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68990","section":"Utah/Wyoming/Nebraska","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=8ETKgDwXO7W_7KcpWIl85Q&viewpoint=41.84686250109069%2C-103.12821872216496&heading=242.75&pitch=-9.209999999999994","text":"Black bollard with long white reflector.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68990"},{"id":"geocoach-usa-bollards-68993","section":"Wyoming(Utah type)","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/@?map_action=pano&pano=D4UvmVQ1anKKyZ0nN9YWPg&viewpoint=43.09177192081439%2C-105.71286206970868&heading=216.9572049799391&pitch=-5.049163528604922","text":"Similar to Utah/Wyoming/Nebraska, but with short white reflector.","countryCodes":["US"],"sourceTagId":"68993"}]}